  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity for COVID19 Response through the Roll Out of mSupply for Vaccine Visibility and Functionality of Cold Chain Equipment (CCE) in Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with UNICEF and Ministry of Health, IOM shall support Public Health Assistants to facilitate the logistics, coordination and management of quarterly visits to 300 deployment sites of the mSupply vaccine supply and monitoring system.</narrative>
  </description>
